1
00:00:00,836 --> 00:00:06,356
A short video about the custody tools in your clinic, and how to report a tool that has a problem.

2
00:00:08,893 --> 00:00:13,785
For each tool you see the standard, how many are in the clinic, and any shortage.

3
00:00:13,785 --> 00:00:18,133
Each handpiece has a serial number that matches the sticker on the tool.

4
00:00:18,584 --> 00:00:24,274
Tap Report and choose the problem: broken, low performance, missing, or other.

5
00:00:26,626 --> 00:00:30,680
Take a photo of the tool, required when it is broken, and tap Send.

6
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:36,126
The report reaches procurement, and the tool leaves your clinic count until it comes back.

7
00:00:36,577 --> 00:00:42,027
Or use the red button at the top. If the tool is not registered, write its serial number.

8
00:00:42,579 --> 00:00:50,239
Follow your reports: received by procurement, under repair, back in the clinic, or damaged. Thank you!
